: {"steamid": "76561197976529166", "personaname": "REVEREND WAR DADDY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976529166/", "num_games_owned": 255, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 3793, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1891, "last_played": 1692270216, "avatar": "8a2b2df0e68b24ddb52cefa49af46a36ec789b69"}, "language": "english", "review": "just pure dumb fun to be had here ... gets your friends together and save the world from big old bugs", "timestamp_created": 1673071727, "timestamp_updated": 1673071727, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130311079", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017512922", "personaname": "Commander Blap", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017512922/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 127, "playtime_forever": 865, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 520, "last_played": 1673722160, "avatar": "950f9f3147d4c8530a5072825d01c34ee3f1afa1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Jank, glitchy, I'd be upset if I played this in 2006, much less today", "timestamp_created": 1673053224, "timestamp_updated": 1673722172, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.351314365863800049", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130297837", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005551894", "personaname": "The Sorrow of Dandy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198005551894/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 14094, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11408, "last_played": 1710811917, "avatar": "e3ef9a0495ef8e28f720a82ba6dcf17460459d26"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love this game. \n\nI'll start with the bad. While this game has a number of negatives, there are only three worth mentioning. 1. The time spent grinding. While grinding is an integral part of the EDF I dislike how the armor farming in particular require you to go back if you play with different friends. There is no quick way to do this so new friends can help you on harder missions. Instead you must do the mission on an unsatisfying easy difficult that will net no new weapons. Despite this, if your friends don't mind dying, you can all have a fun time rag dolling around. 2. Unclear UI or mechanical elements. Enemies tell you to hide in buildings (you can't) weapons aren't always clear in what they do, and statistics are needed to effectively break them down. 3. Helicopters and other vehicles can be an absolute pain to use. There is no up and down for a helicopter in this game, there is only engine on and engine off.\n\nThe good aspects of this game outshine the bad. Despite its lower quality in some respect. EDF is downright hilarious and most of all FUN. It is the most game-game I've ever played. Outright cheesy dialogue, nonsensical weapons, and huge giant insects in a timeline that seemingly didn't have them before. It is a curious assortment of things. The grind to get effective or just interesting weapons keep you coming back to similar missions over and over.  I wholeheartedly recommend EDF if you are alright playing with random people or even better with 1-3 other friends. This game isn't as interesting without a buddy to laugh with. However, I could see the online missions making you a lot of fast friends.", "timestamp_created": 1673039000, "timestamp_updated": 1673039000, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529379010200500488", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}